    <briefdescription>
<para>Factory for the standard JSON HTTP responses used by the <ref refid="namespaceapi_1_1v2" kindref="compound">v2</ref> controllers and filters. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All members are static; the class is a namespace-like utility with no state. The response callbacks are consumed (moved from) exactly once to deliver the reply. failure/error responses wrap the message in a JSON object with a &quot;Status&quot; field, while success responses pass the message through as-is. Every reply is JSON with a 503 response additionally carrying Retry-After: 1. <simplesect kind="note"><para>Copyable but non-movable; construction is unrestricted but meaningless since there is no instance state. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
